{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "nav",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "# Camera｜结构图\n箭头按标签表示调用、持有、数据输出或继承。[[Camera/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机.canvas|主流程]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1410,
			"height": 130,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "pawn",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOPawnData\n`DefaultCameraMode: TSubclassOf<UGGYGOCameraMode>` → 角色/形态选择默认类。\n既有 DA_Pawn_Pyrios 记录选择 Pyrios 参数蓝图；资产回读另验。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 210,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "ga",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOGameplayAbility\n`SetCameraMode(Class)` → 原 Hero/Spec/generation。\n`ApplyCameraOffset(Offset)` → 先 Clear 再 Set。\n仅有效 handle 保存原 Camera/token；\nSetter 拒绝不恢复调用前已 Clear 的资源。\n`EndAbility` 清理先于 Super；\nAvatar/SurvivesDeath 不重放。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|AbilitySystem]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 440,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 285,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "hero",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOHeroComponent\n`DetermineCameraMode()` → 覆盖类/默认类。\n`SetAbilityCameraMode(Class,Spec)` → 代次\n`ClearAbilityCameraMode(Spec,generation)` → 撤销\n唯一 `HandleAbilitySystemUninitialized`：\n清理分支释放输入、覆盖并 Camera Reset。\n后继输入可提前返回；EndPlay 清理。\n[[Input/结构|输入契约]] · [[Camera/结构#解绑协调与后继保护|解绑边界]]",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 290,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "component",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraComponent\n`GetCameraView(dt, OutView)` → UE 入口。\n`SetCameraOffset(Offset)` → 先校验后发号。\nXYZ/FOV 有限，BlendIn/Out 有限非负。\n成功替换/token；失败一次 Error/Invalid。\n拒绝保持入口 Offset/active/alpha/token/序号。\n`ClearCameraOffset(token)` → 仅当前凭证。\n`ResetCameraRuntimeState()` → 清状态。\n持有 Stack/Offset/恢复比例；序号不重置。\n每次拉取：Offset 后至多一次 ECC_Camera。",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 315,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "third",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraMode_ThirdPerson（C++）\n`UpdateView(dt)` → 从 Pawn 视点与控制朝向计算期望位置，并输出穿透请求。\n不访问 World、不 sweep、不保存恢复比例；设计参数仍由派生蓝图覆盖。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 740,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 235,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "pyrios-mode",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## BP_CameraMode_ThirdPerson_Pyrios\n`/Game/Camera/Modes/`\nClass Defaults：构图/混合/穿墙参数。\nDA_Pawn_Pyrios 选类；继承 ThirdPerson。\n[[Camera/结构#设计参数与碰撞策略的归属|参数记录]]；资产回读/PIE 待验。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1000,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "mode",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraMode\n`UpdateCameraMode(dt)` → 清旧请求、调 `UpdateView`、推进权重。\n`GetCameraModeView()` → 单模式 View。\n`GetCameraPenetrationRequest()` → 本帧可选保护请求。\n`GetTargetActor()` → 从 CameraComponent 找目标。",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 680,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 275,
			"color": "4"
		},
		{
			"id": "stack",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOCameraModeStack\n`PushCameraMode(Class)` → 复用实例并置顶。\n`EvaluateStack(dt, OutView, OutRequest)` → View + Request。\n持有实例池/活动栈；按可见贡献聚合。\n`ClearStack()` → 清活动栈，保留实例池。\n不持有 Ability Spec；[[Camera/模式栈实现|实现说明]]。",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 660,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 275,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "view",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## FGGYGOCameraModeView\n`Location` / `Rotation` → 镜头位置和画面朝向。\n`ControlRotation` → 输入所用控制朝向。\n`FieldOfView` / `Blend(Other, Weight)` → 视场角和加权合成。",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 980,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 220,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "controller",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Controller / UE Camera View\nCameraComponent 完成最终解析后：\n`ControlRotation` → Pawn Controller；\n`Location / Rotation / FOV` → 组件和 `FMinimalViewInfo`。\n生产 ViewTarget/PIE 另验。",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 980,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "contract",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## 状态归属与验证边界\nGA 持有原接收者凭证；Hero 持有 Spec+generation；CameraComponent 持有 Offset 单槽 token 与唯一碰撞恢复比例。\nCameraComponent 持有 Stack；Stack 持有模式池/活动栈，输出 View+Request；ThirdPerson 只声明期望视角与保护请求。\nPawnExtension 本地广播到唯一 Hero 入口；后继输入 guard 可提前返回，EndPlay 绕过 guard。\nGate26：完整构建成功，项目 60/60、四 Camera 叶 Success；Offset 活动/回落两状态共 44 次精确拒绝，合法零值通过。\n拒绝 Error 含 Component/Owner/首个字段/原因；耗尽仅静态，GA 先 Clear 的替换事务不在 Setter 保持范围内。\n真实 GI/BeginPlay 解绑仅正常无输入，旧 End 保留新镜头已验；完整 B5/B6/B7、Input/IMC 重入、Avatar 失配、死亡 GE、资产/ViewTarget/PIE/网络仍开放。\n聚合/最终碰撞参数归零与 Mode 混合参数自动替代仍待审查；合法半径0/恢复0/混合时间0继续按正常配置解释。\n[[Camera/结构#当前实现与验证边界|证明范围]] · [[Camera/模式栈实现#已验证与待审查边界|详细边界]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机覆盖恢复.canvas|覆盖恢复]] · [[GGYGO_流程_相机模式求值.canvas|求值流程]]",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1560,
			"width": 1450,
			"height": 360,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "request",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## FGGYGOCameraPenetrationRequest\n`bEnabled / PivotLocation / ProbeRadius / RecoverySpeed`\n只聚合贡献 > 0 且启用的模式。\nPivot 归一加权；Radius 最大；正速度最小。\n全零 Recovery=0 → 立即恢复。\nCameraComponent 消费聚合请求。",
			"x": 500,
			"y": 1240,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 255,
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "pawnext",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## UGGYGOPawnExtensionComponent\n`UninitializeAbilitySystem(ExpectedASC)`：\n匹配才清本地缓存/广播；共享 ASC 仅 Avatar 匹配时清理。\n同 UObject 去重；Hero 单一协调器。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主解绑]] · [[Input/结构|输入]]。",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 1260,
			"width": 390,
			"height": 230,
			"color": "4"
		}
	],
